/figure></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="MarcomSection_section__Hd6T8" data-analytics-section-engagement="name:apple watch compatibility"><div class="section-content"><div class="SectionHeader_container__OMsxL responsive-content_responsiveContent__S1ntz"><h2 class="SectionHeader_headline__aqRKz MarcomSection_enhanced--initial__jX1gR" id="accordion-section-9-header"><span>Birbirleri için yaratıldılar.</span></h2></div><div class="responsive-content_responsiveContent__S1ntz"><div class="ImageAccordion_imageAccordionContainer__WaT9u AccordionSection_enhanced--initial__Mr3MV animationDefaults_noBuildIn__wAp_w"><ul class="ImageAccordion_accordion__vRgS6" role="list" aria-labelledby="accordion-section-9-header"><li class="ImageAccordion_accordionItem__jYIo_" role="listitem"><h3 class="ImageAccordion_accordionItemHeadline__bdCG0 typography_headline__zZkHA"><button class="ImageAccordion_accordionButton__qj7ql" aria-controls="accordion-item-0-tray" type="button" role="button" data-analytics-click="prop3:open accordion - apple watch and iphone" data-analytics-title="open accordion - apple watch and iphone" data-analytics-intrapage-link="" aria-expanded="true"><span class="ImageAccordion_accordionTitleText__6ouHq"><span>Apple Watch ve iPhone</span></span></button></h3><div id="accordion-item-0-tray" class="ImageAccordion_accordionTray__BHx_I"><div class="ImageAccordion_accordionContent__qFdLA"><div><p>Apple Watch ve iPhone’u birlikte kullanarak sayısız özelliğe erişebiliyor ve her iki aygıtınızın da yapabileceği şeyleri daha da iyileştirebiliyorsunuz. Örneğin saatinizde bir bisiklet antrenmanı başlatabiliyor ve ölçümlerinizi otomatik olarak iPhone’unuzda Canlı Etkinlik olarak görebiliyorsunuz.</p></div><div class="ImageAccordion_accordionItemImageContainer__3SNxX"><figure data-vp-w-large="" data-vp-h-large="" data-vp-w-medium="" data-vp-h-medium="" data-vp-w-small="" data-vp-h-small="" style="--vp-w-large:916;--vp-h-large:784;--vp-w-medium:563;--vp-h-medium:418;--vp-w-small:360;--vp-h-small:288;--vp-w-default:916;--vp-h-default:784" class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__VWL7l responsive-picture-vp-layout-default--none responsive-picture__no-js ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--no-load___9Rzr ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--removed__vyAL_ ImageAccordion_accordionImage__bAFHA"><picture class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__jjeBP ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__js__PPGS5"><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="360" height="288" media="(max-width: 734px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="563" height="418" media="(max-width: 1068px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="916" height="784"/><img alt="iPhone 17, Apple Watch Ultra 3, Antrenman uygulamasında fitness bilgileri açık"/></picture><noscript><picture class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__jjeBP ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__no-js__Ma_sk"><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/small/watch_and_iphone_c198dccd4.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/small/watch_and_iphone_c996fca51_2x.jpg 2x" width="360" height="288" media="(max-width: 734px)"/><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/medium/watch_and_iphone_ae0893d44.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/medium/watch_and_iphone_bb40479af_2x.jpg 2x" width="563" height="418" media="(max-width: 1068px)"/><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/large/watch_and_iphone_d6c3f3126.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/large/watch_and_iphone_a2537e516_2x.jpg 2x" width="916" height="784"/><img alt="iPhone 17, Apple Watch Ultra 3, Antrenman uygulamasında fitness bilgileri açık"/></picture></noscript></figure></div></div></div></li><li class="ImageAccordion_accordionItem__jYIo_ ImageAccordion_collapsed__10ccw" role="listitem"><h3 class="ImageAccordion_accordionItemHeadline__bdCG0 typography_headline__zZkHA"><button class="ImageAccordion_accordionButton__qj7ql" aria-controls="accordion-item-1-tray" type="button" role="button" data-analytics-click="prop3:open accordion - apple watch and airpods" data-analytics-title="open accordion - apple watch and airpods" data-analytics-intrapage-link="" aria-expanded="false"><span class="ImageAccordion_accordionTitleText__6ouHq"><span>Apple Watch ve AirPods</span></span></button></h3><div id="accordion-item-1-tray" class="ImageAccordion_accordionTray__BHx_I"><div class="ImageAccordion_accordionContent__qFdLA" inert="" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Apple Watch ve AirPods ile pek çok şey yapabiliyorsunuz. Üstelik iPhone’unuz yanınızda olmasa bile. Telefon görüşmeleri yapın, online müzik ve podcast dinleyin, gelen bildirimlerden haberdar olun. Hatta Siri ile mesajları yanıtlayın.</p></div><div class="ImageAccordion_accordionItemImageContainer__3SNxX"><figure data-vp-w-large="" data-vp-h-large="" data-vp-w-medium="" data-vp-h-medium="" data-vp-w-small="" data-vp-h-small="" style="--vp-w-large:970;--vp-h-large:784;--vp-w-medium:644;--vp-h-medium:314;--vp-w-small:360;--vp-h-small:232;--vp-w-default:970;--vp-h-default:784" class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__VWL7l responsive-picture-vp-layout-default--none responsive-picture__no-js ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--no-load___9Rzr ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--removed__vyAL_ ImageAccordion_accordionImage__bAFHA"><picture class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__jjeBP ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__js__PPGS5"><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="360" height="232" media="(max-width: 734px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="644" height="314" media="(max-width: 1068px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="970" height="784"/><img alt="Apple Watch Series 11, Apple Music uygulaması, şu an çalınan, AirPods Pro 3, beyaz, kulaklık, silikon kulaklık uçları, mikrofon, MagSafe Şarj kutusu, açık, köşeleri yuvarlatılmış"/></picture><noscript><picture class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__jjeBP ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__no-js__Ma_sk"><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/small/watch_and_airpods_ca69e915e.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/small/watch_and_airpods_00b472d2c_2x.jpg 2x" width="360" height="232" media="(max-width: 734px)"/><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/medium/watch_and_airpods_d33417162.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/medium/watch_and_airpods_65f4fa9b9_2x.jpg 2x" width="644" height="314" media="(max-width: 1068px)"/><source srcSet="/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/large/watch_and_airpods_02c7b6346.jpg, /assets-www/tr_TR/watch/image_accordion/large/watch_and_airpods_496301f92_2x.jpg 2x" width="970" height="784"/><img alt="Apple Watch Series 11, Apple Music uygulaması, şu an çalınan, AirPods Pro 3, beyaz, kulaklık, silikon kulaklık uçları, mikrofon, MagSafe Şarj kutusu, açık, köşeleri yuvarlatılmış"/></picture></noscript></figure></div></div></div></li></ul><div class="ImageAccordion_accordionImageContainerLarge__r20NR" aria-hidden="true"><figure data-vp-w-large="" data-vp-h-large="" data-vp-w-medium="" data-vp-h-medium="" data-vp-w-small="" data-vp-h-small="" style="--vp-w-large:916;--vp-h-large:784;--vp-w-medium:563;--vp-h-medium:418;--vp-w-small:360;--vp-h-small:288;--vp-w-default:916;--vp-h-default:784" class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__VWL7l ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture-vp-layout-default--sized__pdVra responsive-picture__no-js ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--no-load___9Rzr ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture--removed__vyAL_ ImageAccordion_accordionImage__bAFHA"><picture class="ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__jjeBP ResponsivePicture_responsive-picture__picture__js__PPGS5"><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="360" height="288" media="(max-width: 734px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="563" height="418" media="(max-width: 1068px)"/><source srcSet="#, # 2x" width="916" height="784"/><img alt="iPhone 17, Apple Watch Ultra 3, Antrenman uygulamasında fitness bil