yku{%nbsp%}uygulamasını kullanabiliyorsunuz. Hatta Apple{%nbsp%}Watch, olası uyku apnesi belirtileri gösterirseniz size bildirim gönderebiliyor.{%sosumi type=\"numbered\" metadata=\"1\"%}","_meta":[{"contentId":"a3f497a55bf86fe2e8011de674d49743db8329d7f183af1191fccfa0a60cbfb0"}]},"r":{"_meta":true}},"a3f497a55bf86fe2e8011de674d49743db8329d7f183af1191fccfa0a60cbfb0":{"a":{"_model":"markdown-inline-copy","textType":"markdown","categories":["legal"],"metadata":[],"_id":"a3f497a55bf86fe2e8011de674d49743db8329d7f183af1191fccfa0a60cbfb0","copy":"Uyku apnesi bildirimleri Apple{%nbsp%}Watch{%nbsp%}Series{%nbsp%}9 ve daha yeni Apple{%nbsp%}Watch{%nbsp%}Series modellerinde, Ultra{%nbsp%}2 ve daha yeni Ultra modellerinde ve SE{%nbsp%}3’te kullanılabilir. Bu özellik, uyku apnesi teşhisi konmamış 18 yaş ve üzerindeki kullanıcıların orta ve ağır düzey uyku apnesi belirtilerini tespit etmek içindir."},"r":{}},"b92dd5da90047bc6ee388230d2233809690bf88a769852e126b078d5d9ffbc86":{"a":{"_model":"asset-set","alt":{"contentId":"257285e1d0f74f6ac7ee84bbcefdde3eb96f1ec3202bb9a967d1166a9191288a"},"viewportSmall":{"contentId":"723db1f71bf11a00026f610d1df257508cb8d88f69d5506432f2b0ada9e59c53"},"viewportMedium":{"contentId":"3b2f395c83b12c6b55c1855a350e94a58c678158ba17885c374b1480b9979274"},"viewportLarge":{"contentId":"c95d842fdfa08d74faa0ca222bfaf3621ab775ea375aa32a763b9fac4f17a51b"},"loop":false,"controls":false,"_id":"b92dd5da90047bc6ee388230d2233809690bf88a769852e126b078d5d9ffbc86"},"r":{"alt":true,"viewportSmall":true,"viewportMedium":true,"viewportLarge":true}},"257285e1d0f74f6ac7ee84bbcefdde3eb96f1ec3202bb9a967d1166a9191288a":{"a":{"_model":"plain-text-copy","textType":"plainText","metadata":[],"_id":"257285e1d0f74f6ac7ee84bbcefdde3eb96f1ec3202bb9a967d1166a9191288a","copy":"İki adet Apple Watch Series 11, uyku skoru ekranı, olası uyku apnesi bildirimi, Spor Loop, siyah ve yeşil gri renkler","_meta":[]},"r":{}},"723db1f71bf11a00026f610d1df257508cb8d88f69d5506432f2b0ada9e59c53":{"a":{"_m