","textType":"markdown","categories":["legal"],"metadata":[],"_id":"572ef03ef2a554a594fc1a8a24c94bd4e149acf251c9e8a7f2fd6bc5d1e3ef3c","copy":"Düzensiz ritim bildirimi için en yeni watchOS ve iOS sürümleri gerekir. Bu özellik 22 yaşın altındaki veya daha önce atriyal fibrilasyon tanısı konmuş kişilerin kullanımına yönelik değildir."},"r":{}},"d7c0ba9818516ee211610504479cb7ad938b5d9711d56ce8bb38dd100b483729":{"a":{"_model":"asset-set","alt":{"contentId":"36bb4673a10e241a5ac0899ef0dbfa23e17f26a6761a3097bf5148c8b2f059da"},"viewportSmall":{"contentId":"8dcfed131692fd754d0aa0e601bd8bc5e986adcabe45aaeb44d86f409ecd7e82"},"viewportMedium":{"contentId":"cecfdf7cd2eead264bab6d169dceaca018e09547f4fb9b6d4effed8f1eccea50"},"viewportLarge":{"contentId":"048f5ece5887f5ad75b98dfc1caed55e6905f078a41b1c385ca6947947625027"},"loop":false,"controls":false,"_id":"d7c0ba9818516ee211610504479cb7ad938b5d9711d56ce8bb38dd100b483729"},"r":{"alt":true,"viewportSmall":true,"viewportMedium":true,"viewportLarge":true}},"36bb4673a10e241a5ac0899ef0dbfa23e17f26a6761a3097bf5148c8b2f059da":{"a":{"_model":"plain-text-copy","textType":"plainText","metadata":[],"_id":"36bb4673a10e241a5ac0899ef0dbfa23e17f26a6761a3097bf5148c8b2f059da","copy":"Apple Watch Series 11, alüminyum kasa, uzay grisi renk, Kalp Atış Hızı uygulaması, şu an dakikadaki vuruş sayısı, Örgü Solo Loop, demir mavisi","_meta":[]},"r":{}},"8dcfed131692fd754d0aa0e601bd8bc5e986adcabe45aaeb44d86f409ecd7e82":{"a":{"_model":"pinnable-image","uri1x":"/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/feature_card_boc/small/modal_health_ecg_ea86604a6.jpg","uri2x":"/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/feature_card_boc/small/modal_health_ecg_7730ab1e6_2x.jpg","pinning":"center left","_id":"8dcfed131692fd754d0aa0e601bd8bc5e986adcabe45aaeb44d86f409ecd7e82","width1x":420,"height1x":448,"width2x":840,"height2x":896},"r":{}},"cecfdf7cd2eead264bab6d169dceaca018e09547f4fb9b6d4effed8f1eccea50":{"a":{"_model":"pinnable-image","uri1x":"/assets-www/tr_TR/watch/feature_card_boc/medium/modal_health_ecg_8